  diseaseId: lupus
  diseaseName: LUPUS
  generalInfo: "Lupus, ba\u011F\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131k sisteminin kendi dokular\u0131na
    sald\u0131rd\u0131\u011F\u0131 kronik otoimm\xFCn bir hastal\u0131kt\u0131r.
    Hastalarda yorgunluk, eklem a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 ve sistemik belirtiler g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "Yorgunluk belirgin olmas\u0131, \xE7arp\u0131nt\u0131 mevcut olmas\u0131,
    yayg\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131 var olmas\u0131 ve el ve bileklerde a\u011Fr\u0131
    var olmas\u0131 lupus hastalar\u0131nda s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir.
    Baz\u0131 hastalarda s\u0131cak basmas\u0131 var olabilir."
